sequenceDiagram
  participant G as Guest
  participant UI as Frontend
  participant API as Backend
  participant DB as Database
  participant PAY as PaymentGateway

  G->>UI: Search hotel & select room
  UI->>API: GET /hotels/:id /rooms?dates
  API->>DB: query availability
  DB-->>API: availability
  API-->>UI: show availability
  G->>UI: Submit booking + payment
  UI->>API: POST /bookings
  API->>DB: create booking (status: pending)
  API->>PAY: create payment intent
  PAY-->>API: payment confirmed
  API->>DB: update booking (status: confirmed)
  API-->>UI: booking confirmation
  API->>G: send notification/email
